\hspace{1cm}\text{s.t.} \hspace{1cm} b^Tb \leq 1\\
\hspace{1cm}\hspace{1cm} \sum_{k=1}^n c_k=1
\]
where $c_k$ is the $k$-th element of $c$. Determine if the value of $P$ is always positive. Write your answer in \boxed{} format.<|im_end|>
